[I] PAM module component of the oo7 keyring project

[T] oo7 is a Rust implementation of the freedesktop.org Secret Service API.
[T] This package builds the `pam` sub-crate of the oo7 workspace, a PAM module
[T] that unlocks the login keyring on successful login.

[U] https://github.com/linux-credentials/oo7

[A] Bilal Elmoussaoui
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/security

[L] MIT
